[gd_resource type="Environment" load_steps=2 format=3]

; The town at night. Brighter than the dungeon but still firelit and blue-shifted
; — the point of coming back is relief, and relief needs contrast. If the town
; matched the dungeon's near-black ambient, extracting would not feel like
; arriving anywhere.

